# Files kept out of the backend deployment (Vercel project "chiron-api", root = repo root).
# CAREFUL: Vercel applies this repo-root file to EVERY project built from this repo, including
# the frontend (root web/). Never list web/ here; the backend bundle drops it via vercel.json.
frontend/
# data/: only the grillas ship (agents/grilla.py grades against them); course notes, audio and chunks stay out
data/ecoe/audios/
data/ecoe/*/clean/
data/ecoe/*/raw/
data/ecoe/*/chunks.jsonl
data/ecoe/*/sources.json
data/ecoe/contexto-ecoe.md
docs/
evals/
tests/
deploy/
secrets/
.chroma/
requirements.txt
Dockerfile
.gcloudignore
ARCHITECTURE.md
api/fake_session.py
rag/clean_pdfs.py
rag/chunk.py
rag/ingest.py
rag/query.py
rag/to_pgvector.py
llm/probe_models.py
